        </p>
        <p>
          If a business operates at a Quick Ratio of 4.0, every $1.00 lost to customer attrition is counterbalanced by $4.00 of newly captured and expanded revenue. Consequently, 75% of incoming revenue directly expands the business's net balance sheet, while only 25% is consumed filling the leaky bucket.
        </p>

        <!-- Benchmark Table -->
        <div class="overflow-x-auto my-6">
